      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUBBLE COASTER (4) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 7 lengths into third (20.15) at this track in a TG1-4W over 342m. Must come into calculations. BALUARTE (2) resumed from a break finishing fourth (17.30) at Murray Bridge Straight in a Grade 6. Will be much improved. Has good speed and a low draw is a big help. Bold showing expected. PHOTO CRUSHER (1) started big odds in far stiffer grade latest when finishing 6th over 400m at Gawler. Was a winner the start prior in easier at Gawler. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Likely to play a prominent role. TATAMAGOUCHE (7) did a good job to finish second last time out over 395m at Murray Bridge (22.91) in a Grade 6, the second top-three finish on the trot. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide.",
